    "body": "Added shared Confirm, Back, Move, Launch, Exit, and Save sound slots, the default-on global Sound setting, private cached extraction, and a Developer Mode coverage table. FF8 maps records 1, 9, 29, and 37 across the six roles. FF7 maps 1, 2, and 4; Launch remains unavailable because no game-start record was proved. Extraction converts the game ADPCM records to browser-safe PCM, and Edge decoded every FF8 slot plus all five mapped FF7 slots. Please confirm the sound choices by ear.",
